OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening with sunny spells. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry with
OL,8,Flengthy clear periods. A chilly night
OL,9,Fin sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a dry
OL,12,Fand bright day. The best of the sunny
OL,13,Fspells in the east.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,16,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,17,FSunday. Dry with long sunny spells on
OL,18,FMonday and becoming a little warmer.
OL,19,FOutbreaks of rain spread north on
OL,20,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
